id: masterful-integration
name: Masterful Integration
talentCategory: racial
race: android
prerequisites: Android Race, Machine Mutant Factor
description: >
  You are able to make the most of the items you’ve Integrated.
text: >
  Masterful Integration: You are able to make the most of the items you’ve Integrated.
  –Prerequisites: Android Race, Machine Mutant Factor
  (1)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When making an Attacking Maneuver, you may destroy an Integrated Item to apply an Energy Charge to that Attacking Maneuver.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: When you destroy an Integrated Apparel through your own effects, you may apply one of its Apparel Qualities to another applicable Apparel you have Integrated.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: When you destroy an Integrated Weapon through your own effects, you may apply one of its Weapon Qualities to another applicable Weapon you have Integrated.

---

[passive]
# (1) Asked as an Attacking Maneuver is declared, once a Round: which Integrated Item is destroyed - a Weapon broken, Apparel
# broken, an Accessory gone - for an Energy Charge on it (maneuvers.mjs askMasterfulCharge).
allow masterful.charge;
# (2), (3) An Integrated Apparel or Weapon destroyed by your own effect - (1), Furious Flex (2): asked, once an Encounter each,
# which of its Qualities onto which other Integrated piece of its kind (maneuvers.mjs masterfulMove).
allow masterful.apparel;
allow masterful.weapon;
